[33.901357, "o", "\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KB\bB\r\u001b[K      which the Council of the Home can tell the hours of the day and\r\n:\u001b[K"]
[33.945211, "o", "\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KB\bB\r\u001b[K      when to ring the bell. When the bell rings, we all arise from our\r\n:\u001b[K"]
[33.966756, "o", "\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KB\bB\r\u001b[K      beds. The sky is green and cold in our windows to the east. The\r\n:\u001b[K"]
