[35.667017, "o", "\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KB\bB\r\u001b[K      are white and clean and bare of all things save one hundred beds.\r\n:\u001b[K"]
[35.697124, "o", "\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KB\bB\r\u001b[K\r\n:\u001b[K"]
[35.729653, "o", "\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KB\bB\r\u001b[K      Thus have we lived each day of four years, until two springs ago\r\n:\u001b[K"]
[35.762963, "o", "\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KB\bB\r\u001b[K      when our crime happened. Thus must all men live until they are\r\n:\u001b[K"]
[35.83861, "o", "\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KB\bB\r\u001b[K      forty. At forty, they are worn out. At forty, they are sent to\r\n:\u001b[K\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KB\bB\r\u001b[K"]
