[38.323453, "o", "\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KB\bB\r\u001b[K      Theatre. We left them to lie in the shade of the Theatre tent and\r\n:\u001b[K"]
