[45.10311, "o", "\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KB\bB\r\u001b[K      Then we walked away together and back to the Home of the Street\r\n:\u001b[K"]
[45.133941, "o", "\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KB\bB\r\u001b[K      Sweepers. And we walked in silence.\r\n:\u001b[K"]
[45.164969, "o", "\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KB\bB\r\u001b[K\r\n:\u001b[K"]
[45.198589, "o", "\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KB\bB\r\u001b[K      Thus did it come to pass that each night, when the stars are high\r\n:\u001b[K"]
[45.230046, "o", "\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KB\bB\r\u001b[K      and the Street Sweepers sit in the City Theatre, we, Equality\r\n:\u001b[K"]
[45.26183, "o", "\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KB\bB\r\u001b[K      7-2521, steal out and run through the darkness to our place. It\r\n:\u001b[K"]
[45.294523, "o", "\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KB\bB\r\u001b[K      is easy to leave the Theatre; when the candles are blown out and\r\n:\u001b[K"]
[45.325336, "o", "\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KB\bB\r\u001b[K      the Actors come onto the stage, no eyes can see us as we crawl\r\n:\u001b[K"]
[45.410489, "o", "\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KB\bB\r\u001b[K      under our seat and under the cloth of the tent. Later, it is easy\r\n:\u001b[K"]
[45.411053, "o", "\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KB\bB\r\u001b[K      to steal through the shadows and fall in line next to\r\n:\u001b[K"]
[45.428273, "o", "\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KB\bB\r\u001b[K      International 4-8818, as the column leaves the Theatre. It is\r\n:\u001b[K"]
[45.451971, "o", "\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KB\bB\r\u001b[K      dark in the streets and there are no men about, for no men may\r\n:\u001b[K"]
[45.485068, "o", "\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KB\bB\r\u001b[K      walk through the City when they have no mission to walk there.\r\n:\u001b[K"]
[45.517492, "o", "\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KB\bB\r\u001b[K      Each night, we run to the ravine, and we remove the stones which\r\n:\u001b[K"]
[45.548798, "o", "\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KB\bB\r\u001b[K      we have piled upon the iron grill to hide it from the men. Each\r\n:\u001b[K"]
[45.58061, "o", "\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KB\bB\r\u001b[K      night, for three hours, we are under the earth, alone.\r\n:\u001b[K"]
[45.612758, "o", "\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KB\bB\r\u001b[K\r\n:\u001b[K"]
[45.646297, "o", "\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KB\bB\r\u001b[K      We have stolen candles from the Home of the Street Sweepers, we\r\n:\u001b[K"]
[45.67787, "o", "\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KB\bB\r\u001b[K      have stolen flints and knives and paper, and we have brought them\r\n:\u001b[K"]
[45.71116, "o", "\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KB\bB\r\u001b[K      to this place. We have stolen glass vials and powders and acids\r\n:\u001b[K"]
[45.741477, "o", "\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KB\bB\r\u001b[K      from the Home of the Scholars. Now we sit in the tunnel for three\r\n:\u001b[K"]
[45.7736, "o", "\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KB\bB\r\u001b[K      hours each night and we study. We melt strange metals, and we mix\r\n:\u001b[K"]
[45.803947, "o", "\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KB\bB\r\u001b[K      acids, and we cut open the bodies of the animals which we find in\r\n:\u001b[K"]
[45.834992, "o", "\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KB\bB\r\u001b[K      the City Cesspool. We have built an oven of the bricks we\r\n:\u001b[K"]
[45.868827, "o", "\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KB\bB\r\u001b[K      gathered in the streets. We burn the wood we find in the ravine.\r\n:\u001b[K"]
[45.898957, "o", "\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KB\bB\r\u001b[K      The fire flickers in the oven and blue shadows dance upon the\r\n:\u001b[K"]
[45.930725, "o", "\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KB\bB\r\u001b[K      walls, and there is no sound of men to disturb us.\r\n:\u001b[K"]
[45.963997, "o", "\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KB\bB\r\u001b[K\r\n:\u001b[K"]
[45.996218, "o", "\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KB\bB\r\u001b[K      We have stolen manuscripts. This is a great offense. Manuscripts\r\n:\u001b[K"]
[46.02762, "o", "\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KB\bB\r\u001b[K      are precious, for our brothers in the Home of the Clerks spend\r\n:\u001b[K"]
[46.059076, "o", "\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KB\bB\r\u001b[K      one year to copy one single script in their clear handwriting.\r\n:\u001b[K"]
[46.092686, "o", "\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KB\bB\r\u001b[K      Manuscripts are rare and they are kept in the Home of the\r\n:\u001b[K"]
[46.121288, "o", "\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KB\bB\r\u001b[K      Scholars. So we sit under the earth and we read the stolen\r\n:\u001b[K"]
[46.160848, "o", "\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KB\bB\r\u001b[K      scripts. Two years have passed since we found this place. And in\r\n:\u001b[K"]
[46.195403, "o", "\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KB\bB\r\u001b[K      these two years we have learned more than we had learned in the\r\n:\u001b[K"]
[46.218004, "o", "\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KB\bB\r\u001b[K      ten years of the Home of the Students.\r\n:\u001b[K"]
[46.249999, "o", "\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KB\bB\r\u001b[K\r\n:\u001b[K"]
